+#
+# A JUMP waiting at the idle get is taken when the title stores put, so a
+# command block the title reuses right after is not read again by the walker:
+# a hand-built ring, an injected block, its memory overwritten after put moves
+# back. No graphics backend and no lifted game. Built with the runtime
+# (PS3RECOMP_BUILD_TESTS).
